diff --git a/TRIAGE.md b/TRIAGE.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c85bfea
--- /dev/null
+++ b/TRIAGE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Root cause: #34 made shopcore/__init__.py lazy, so tests can import shopcore.shipping or shopcore.tax before shopcore.pricing.
+shipping/tax and pricing import each other; the eager __init__ always imported pricing first, which avoided the error.
+Fix: restore the eager imports in __init__ so the package always initialises in a safe order.
